ype": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 13:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880161658,47288722,1749]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=150058]-阿狼-[/uid] (2026-08-31 10:39):[/b]<br/><br/>不卖  前面几天不卖为什么今天才来卖。[/quote]<br/>我从来观点都是很明确的。", "lou": 651, "content_length": 29, "reply_to": 880161658, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788154237}, {"pid": 880182694, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 60, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 13:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880182518,47288722,1763]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65329649]zippo578[/uid] (2026-08-31 13:32):[/b]<br/><br/>如果<br/>我是说如果<br/>明天上午11点半，能收在3990上面<br/>这次准备空一下500试试<br/>150点止损[s:ac:喘][/quote]<br/>明天别空 等蓝筹调整的时候空  差不多了  等GJD卖第三天的时候。目前只卖了一天。", "lou": 652, "content_length": 76, "reply_to": 880182518, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788154433}, {"pid": 880183348, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 40, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 13:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880182971,47288722,1764]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65329649]zippo578[/uid] (2026-08-31 13:36):[/b]<br/><br/>哥<br/>这么细致的么。。<br/>那我多观察下[s:pst:哭2][/quote]<br/>你看这个上证K线组合像不像诱多  红三兵加个低位顶分型  <br/>突破的概率不小的。这个突破的时候才是杀人的时候  目前不是。", "lou": 653, "content_length": 110, "reply_to": 880182971, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788154825}, {"pid": 880183518, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 13:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880183318,47288722,1764]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62058466]oldcat997[/uid] (2026-08-31 13:40):[/b]<br/><br/>这个我知道，陪女朋友看了点，感觉还可以的，讲大学生和老板的职场恋爱故事，不过剧版有改动说是谈个地下恋爱，小说里只是肉体关系[/quote]<br/>我不看原著  只是这次剧集质量很高<br/>我是长期看韩剧的  这部剧不亚于韩剧质量  <br/>不管是故事流畅度还是表现手法 人物刻画 场景服饰都很不错。", "lou": 654, "content_length": 125, "reply_to": 880183318, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788154935}, {"pid": 880184035, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 38, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 13:47", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880183820,47288722,1765]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=42823755]还是不是云[/uid] (2026-08-31 13:45):[/b]<br/><br/>那为啥不小仓位入点等个突破后t出呢，GJD都又继续画线了[/quote]<br/>我有持仓啊  我又不像你们空仓。", "lou": 655, "content_length": 33, "reply_to": 880183820, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788155236}, {"pid": 880184769, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 44, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 13:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880184633,47288722,1766]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67177520]Amam2haruna[/uid] (2026-08-31 13:52):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大 突破概率不小的话 会进一点金融吗 上周说寻找机会进 那是已经进了还是最终没发现好位置或者觉得可能不是他们作为方向 最终还是没进[/quote]<br/>跌得不够多啊  没有好的差价位置。", "lou": 656, "content_length": 35, "reply_to": 880184633, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788155653}, {"pid": 880187704, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 98, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 14:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我都不懂你们在紧张什么<br/>这个不是我说的预期内么  本来就是预期他拉起来诱多啊<br/>急什么  正在打窝呢。", "lou": 657, "content_length": 88, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788157160}, {"pid": 880188331, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 57, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-31 14:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880188108,47288722,1770]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67142257]兰斯洛t[/uid] (2026-08-31 14:22):[/b]<br/><br/>今天比较有趣的是，月线死叉这个诱空的技术面，如果一直生拉到尾盘就修复了，修复了就又转诱多，笑晕了。[/quote]<br/>就那种半桶水的技术派在那宣扬什么月线死叉<br/>看到就想笑<br/>拿着个图在画画画的。", "lou": 658, "content_length": 75, "reply_to": 880188108, "from_client": "0 /", "p